# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# The console is a hash-router SPA (`#/workspace`, `#/docs`, ...), so every
# route resolves to the single index.html the browser already loaded — a
# server-side rewrite is only needed for a DIRECT hit on a path that is not a
# real file (e.g. a stale bookmark to `/workspace`). `docs.html` is a REAL
# file in the build and is served directly; it must NOT be swallowed by the
# SPA fallback, hence it is excluded below.

# Serve the docs page as-is (static, its own in-page hash router).
/docs.html /docs.html 200

# SPA fallback: anything else that is not a built asset resolves to the app.
# Placed last so real files (assets/*, deepscout.svg, docs.html) win.
/* /index.html 200
